<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Oct 25.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of harvest progress to Oct 25.</p>
<p>CROP			COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat  84</p>
<p>Canada Prairie Spring  80</p>
<p>Soft White Spring     100</p>
<p>Winter Wheat	    100</p>
<p>Durum Wheat		97</p>
<p>Oats			 80</p>
<p>Barley		     86</p>
<p>Flax			 59</p>
<p>Fall Rye		   86</p>
<p>Canola		     92</p>
<p>Total:		     86</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
